{"sourceUrl":"https://rcees.cas.cn/tzg/tzgg/jyc_200780/202505/t20250512_7649907.html","status":"full","attemptedAt":"2026-11-15T16:59:11.981260+00:00","httpStatus":200,"fetchedUrl":"https://rcees.cas.cn/tzg/tzgg/jyc_200780/202505/t20250512_7649907.html","html":"<div>\n<div>\n<h1>生态环境研究中心2025年“生态环境与健康”主题全国优秀大学生夏令营营员招募通知<br/></h1>\n<div>\n<div>\n<span>日期：2025-05-12</span>\n<span>  | 【  <a>小</a> <a>中</a> <a>大</a>  】 |  </span>\n<a href=\"https://rcees.cas.cn/tzg/tzgg/jyc_200780/202505/t20250512_7649907.html\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">【打印】</a>\n<a href=\"https://rcees.cas.cn/tzg/tzgg/jyc_200780/202505/t20250512_7649907.html\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">【关闭】</a>\n</div>\n<div>\n<div>\n<div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div>\n<div><p><br/></p><p><span><span><span><span>为激发大学生的科研兴趣和科研潜力，零距离体验生态环境与健康科学的魅力，选拔优秀大学生到生态环境研究中心深造，生态环境研究中心将于</span></span></span></span><span><span>2025</span></span><span><span><span><span>年</span></span></span></span><span><span>7</span></span><span><span><span><span>月举办第</span></span></span></span><span><span>13</span></span><span><span><span><span>届“生态环境与健康”主题全国优秀大学生夏令营。欢迎有意攻读生态环境研究中心硕士和博士（直博生）学位的同学参加本次活动！现将相关安排通知如下：</span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span>一、时 间：</span></span></span></span><span><span>2025</span></span><span><span><span><span>年</span></span></span></span><span><span>7</span></span><span><span><span><span>月</span></span></span></span><span><span>7</span></span><span><span><span><span>日</span></span></span></span><span><span>-10</span></span><span><span><span><span>日</span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span>二、地 点：中国科学院生态环境研究中心</span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span>三、拟招人数：</span></span></span></span><span><span>120</span></span><span><span><span><span>人</span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span>四、报名条件</span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span></span></span></span></span><span><span>1</span></span><span><span><span><span>、一流大学及环境科学与工程、生态学、化学、生物学、医学、地学、农学、生命科学及相关专业一流学科</span></span></span></span><span><span>2022</span></span><span><span><span><span>级本科生（五年制医学院</span></span></span></span><span><span>2021</span></span><span><span><span><span>级本科生）；</span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span></span></span></span></span><span><span>2</span></span><span><span><span><span>、本科期间成绩优秀，有志于科研工作，总评成绩排名在本学院或专业前</span></span></span></span><span><span>20%</span></span><span><span><span><span>之内；</span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span></span></span></span></span><span><span>3</span></span><span><span><span><span>、身心健康，无不良嗜好，无违法违纪受处分记录；</span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span></span></span></span></span><span><span>4</span></span><span><span><span><span>、英语达到国家四</span></span></span></span><span><span>/</span></span><span><span><span><span>六级水平。</span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span>五、报名办法及录取</span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span></span></span></span></span><span><span>1</span></span><span><span><span><span>、报名时间：即日起至</span></span></span></span><span><span>6</span></span><span><span><span><span>月</span></span></span></span><span><span>5</span></span><span><span><span><span>日，包括网上报名和发送电子版材料。</span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span></span></span></span></span><span><span>2</span></span><span><span><span><span>、报名流程</span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span>登录中国科学院夏令营在线申请平台 </span></span></span></span><span><span>http://zxsq.ucas.ac.cn/login/index/sc</span></span><span><span><span><span>，“承办夏令营单位”搜索选择“生态环境研究中心”，并进行信息填报；填写完成后的申请表无需下载打印，仅供系统审核使用。</span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span>报名阶段需要提交以下电子版材料。</span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span></span></span></span></span><span><span>A.</span></span><span><span><span><span>夏令营报名表（附件</span></span></span></span><span><span>1</span></span><span><span><span><span>，非报名系统中报名表），需学生本人、班主任或辅导员签字，院系加盖公章；</span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span></span></span></span></span><span><span>B.</span></span><span><span><span><span>身份证复印件（正反面）；</span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span></span></span></span></span><span><span>C.</span></span><span><span><span><span>成绩单和专业排名证明（需加盖教务处公章或成绩单专用章）；</span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span></span></span></span></span><span><span>D.</span></span><span><span><span><span>其他证明材料，包括已发表论文或出版物复印件、英语四</span></span></span></span><span><span>/</span></span><span><span><span><span>六级成绩单复印件、证书复印件等（可选材料）。</span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span>以上电子版材料请于</span></span></span></span><span><span>6</span></span><span><span><span><span>月</span></span></span></span><span><span>5</span></span><span><span><span><span>日前，按以上顺序合并成一个</span></span></span></span><span><span>PDF</span></span><span><span><span><span>文档发送至姜老师邮箱</span></span></span></span><span><span>nnjiang@rcees.ac.cn</span></span><span><span><span><span>（请勿以超大附件形式发送），邮件主题和附件的命名方式均为“姓名</span></span></span></span><span><span>+</span></span><span><span><span><span>本科学校</span></span></span></span><span><span>+</span></span><span><span><span><span>夏令营报名”，发送前请认真检查材料的清晰度，尤其是成绩单。</span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span></span></span></span></span><span><span>3</span></span><span><span><span><span>、录取</span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span>生态环境中心将根据报名材料进行筛选，录取名单和报到时间地点将于</span></span></span></span><span><span>2025</span></span><span><span><span><span>年</span></span></span></span><span><span>6</span></span><span><span><span><span>月</span></span></span></span><span><span>13</span></span><span><span><span><span>日在生态环境研究中心网站公布（</span></span></span></span><span><span>http://rcees.ac.cn</span></span><span><span><span><span>），请届时查看。未入选者不再另行通知。</span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span>同时，生态环境研究中心会在网上对申请者进行资格审核，如果录取，“申请进度”中显示已经通过审核，请各位学员在</span></span></span></span><span><span>6</span></span><span><span><span><span>月</span></span></span></span><span><span>17</span></span><span><span><span><span>日前在系统中选择是否确定同意参加。不在系统做选择则默认为不同意参加。</span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span>六、主要活动内容 </span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span>生态环境研究中心介绍、科学家专题报告、科研平台参观、与导师见面交流等； </span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span>七、注意事项</span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span></span></span></span></span><span><span>1</span></span><span><span><span><span>、报名材料须真实有效，如弄虚作假，将取消录取资格，并将情况通报申请人学校（无需邮寄纸质材料）。</span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span>2</span></span><span><span><span><span>、要求营员身体健康，患先天疾病、心脏病或哮喘等突发病者不能参加；运动禁忌类疾病患者及患病未康复者不能参加。</span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span></span></span></span></span><span><span>3</span></span><span><span><span><span>、请勿携带金银首饰等贵重物品入营。</span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span></span></span></span></span><span><span>4</span></span><span><span><span><span>、夏令营名额有限，被录取后确定不来参加夏令营的，请及时通知我们，以便为其他想参与活动的学生提供宝贵机会。</span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span>5</span></span><span><span><span><span>、夏令营期间我中心为营员统一提供住宿，免收食宿费，请自备个人日常用品。</span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span>6</span></span><span><span><span><span>、营员应遵守生态环境研究中心有关规定和夏令营统一安排，按时参加活动。</span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span>7</span></span><span><span><span><span>、夏令营期间学生安全由学生本人及学籍所在学校负责，夏令营将统一为营员购买人身意外伤害保险，现场报到时提交纸质版夏令营安全承诺书。</span></span></span></span></p><p><a href=\"https://rcees.cas.cn/tzg/tzgg/jyc_200780/202505/t20250512_7649907.html\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"></a><span><span><span><span>　　八、联系方式</span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span>联系部门：教育处 夏令营咨询：周老师</span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span>联系电话：</span></span></span></span><span><span>010-62849161 </span></span><span><span><span><span>邮编：</span></span></span></span><span><span>100085</span></span></p><p><span><span>E-mail</span></span><span><span><span><span>：</span></span></span></span><span><span><a href=\"mailto:yingzhou@rcees.ac.cn\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span><span>yingzhou@rcees.ac.cn</span></span></a></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span><span><span>地址：北京市海淀区双清路</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span>18</span></span><span><span><span><span>号</span></span></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span>附件</span></span></span></span><span><span>1</span></span><span><span><span><span>：夏令营申请表</span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span>附件</span></span></span></span><span><span>2</span></span><span><span><span><span>：夏令营安全承诺书</span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span>生态环境研究中心</span></span></span></span><span><span>Bilibili</span></span><span><span><span><span>官方账号：</span></span></span></span></p><p><img alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://rcees.cas.cn/tzg/tzgg/jyc_200780/202505/W020250512350432084496_ORIGIN.png\"/></p><p><span><span><span><span>生态环境研究中心研究生会公众号：</span></span></span></span></p><p><img alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://rcees.cas.cn/tzg/tzgg/jyc_200780/202505/W020250512350432375304_ORIGIN.png\"/></p><p><br/></p><p><br/></p><p><br/></p><p><span><span><span><span>教育处</span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span>2025</span></span><span><span><span><span>年</span></span></span></span><span><span>5</span></span><span><span><span><span>月</span></span></span></span><span><span>12</span></span><span><span><span><span>日</span></span></span></span></p><p></p></div>\n</div>\n\n<div>\n<hr/>\n<p>附件：</p>\n<ul>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>","textSha256":"f9566747fbd69c04ac3b529e6f2a5d548300b8b86cef6fd651e23367303dda92","textLength":1566,"sourceSha256":"6fa0f1daae41d63baf593599f5cfa0fd52324afbebd9354529a0f0e6dda5fd19","selector":"article-like:details-page","attachments":[],"pdfs":[],"unavailableMedia":[],"id":"syp-813588b168f0eaa183ab","title":"2025年中国科学院生态环境研究中心2025年“生态环境与健康”主题全国优秀大学生夏令营营员招募通知","capturedAt":"2026-11-15T16:59:11.981260+00:00"}
